{"content":[{"c":["BAMOTH, BAMOTH-BAAL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Town in Moab allotted to Reuben’s tribe by Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.17","r":"Josh.13.17","rawR":"Josh.13.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.17","value":"Josh.13.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13:17"},", called Bamoth-baal). It had been one of Israel’s last encampments on the route into Canaan, the Promised Land (",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.19-20","r":"Num.21.19-20","rawR":"Num.21.19-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.19-20","value":"Num.21.19-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 21:19-20"},"). Bamoth-baal, a mountain or high place, was probably a shrine to the Canaanite god Baal. King Balak of Moab took the prophet Balaam there to try to get him to curse Balak’s enemies, the people of Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Num.22.41-23.13","r":"Num.22.41-23.13","rawR":"Num.22.41-23.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.22.41-23.13","value":"Num.22.41-23.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"22:41–23:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BamothBamothBaal","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 13:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.17","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.17","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.17"},{"anchorText":"Nm 21:19-20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.19-20","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.19-20","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.19-20"},{"anchorText":"22:41–23:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.22.41-23.13","rawQueryValue":"Num.22.41-23.13","sourceRefExact":"Num.22.41-23.13"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"00a7acdb18b70a34a2087231742f3bcad15ff80954b47589a40906dcaa446833","sourceItemName":"BamothBamothBaal","sourceItemOrder":61,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BamothBamothBaal","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Bamoth, Bamoth-Baal","title":"Bamoth, Bamoth-Baal","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}